cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this archive, please cite the version-specific Zenodo record."
title: "Thermal modular commutators as joint probes of gauge flux and broken time-reversal symmetry in axial spin networks: source and validation archive"
type: software
version: "0.6.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JeromeNicolas2026/thermal-modular-commutators"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nicolas"
    given-names: "Jérôme"
    affiliation: "Lycée Saint-Charles, Marseille, France"
contact:
  - family-names: "Nicolas"
    given-names: "Jérôme"
    email: "jerome.nicolas@ac-aix-marseille.fr"
abstract: >-
  Source package and validation code for the manuscript "Thermal modular
  commutators as joint probes of gauge flux and broken time-reversal symmetry
  in axial spin networks." The archive contains REVTeX and portable LaTeX
  sources, a rendered preprint, exact-arithmetic certificates for the
  arbitrary-spin unicyclic onset theorem and the axial boundary, numerical
  ring checks, and SHA-256 checksums for the deposited files.
keywords:
  - "modular commutator"
  - "quantum spin networks"
  - "gauge flux"
  - "Wilson loop"
  - "Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya interaction"
  - "high-temperature expansion"
  - "exact arithmetic"
  - "Jordan-Wigner transformation"
